<main class="card story"><div class="story-top"><div class="location-tag" id="location">Morrow House · North dormitory</div><div class="day-tag" id="day">Autumn · Day 1</div></div><article class="story-content"><div class="chapter-label" id="chapterLabel">Prologue · A quiet wrongness</div><div class="scene-art" id="sceneArt" aria-hidden="true">⌁</div><h1 id="sceneTitle">The letter under your pillow</h1><div class="prose" id="prose"></div><div id="dialogue"></div><div id="ending"></div><div class="choices" id="choices"></div><div class="create-box" id="createBox"><div class="create-head"><div class="create-title"><span>✦</span>Make something real</div><div class="create-note">Your imagination is the only rule.</div></div><form class="input-row" id="imagineForm"><input id="imagineInput" maxlength="180" autocomplete="off" placeholder="I imagine that…" aria-label="Describe what you imagine"><button class="manifest-btn" type="submit">Imagine it <span>↗</span></button></form><div class="hint" id="hint">A key, a kindness, a door where there wasn't one. Try anything.</div></div><div class="feed"><div class="feed-head"><span>What the world remembers</span><span class="small-label" id="turnLabel">TURN 01</span></div><div class="feed-lines" id="feedLines"><span class="feed-chip muted">A blank page, a held breath</span></div></div></article></main></div><div class="footer-note">No two imagined things need become the same thing twice</div></div>
